    <text>
        <body>
            <div n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg006.perseus-eng2" type="translation" xml:lang="eng">
                <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="1">
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" n="2">
                        <div type="textpart" subtype="section" n="17">
                            <p>He halted his chariot in front of the phalanx and gave the
                                order to advance.<note anchored="true">A Perseus note that
                                    must be removed.</note></p>
                        </div>
                        <div type="textpart" subtype="section" n="18">
                            <p>As for the barbarians, they were frightened; the Cilician
                                queen took to flight.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
